  <item>
    <title>Vol.59 不好意思用显微镜看了《再见爱人》第四季第五期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67681c7615a5fd520ea55629</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67681c7615a5fd520ea55629</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有话说」</span></p><span></span><p><span>XXX说过：解释就是掩饰，掩饰就是事实</span></p><span></span><p><span>是谁导演这场戏在这孤单角色里？自爆玩脱了怎么办啊？在悬崖边思考番外篇let's胡编，好死不死一阵阴风，竟把剧本递上前</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 熏鸡事件见真情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 她笑他也笑，他们不笑他不笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 别拿导游不当官</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 烧钱做快餐黑红也是红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 尊重都是相互的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 他越瞧不上她，她越要证明自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 冷脸洗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 是谁导演这场戏在这孤单角色里？自爆玩脱了怎么办啊？在悬崖边思考番外篇let's胡编，好死不死一阵阴风，竟把剧本递上前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 慌张的他的三次自爆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 慌到只想狡辩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 他选她不是因为她好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 阴风带卡片带你进入他的剧本，你们夫妻俩双双入局，而他孤单热演连环叩问将剧情推向高潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 为啥这么想被关注精神世界满足精神需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 演到忘我演到人设崩塌演到观众全部离场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 讨厌她又离不开她</span></p><span></span><p><span>「听我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrxFZ0Kk7W5dvuPGv8KQycWVN4m_.m4a" length="43759182" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5AffZNiOdt4SJrmmp5aldpiHGX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.58 不好意思用显微镜看了《再见爱人》第四季第四期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675db4e084447b1bd0e560b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675db4e084447b1bd0e560b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有话说」</span></p><span></span><p><span>即不内观也不自省的他，却拥有如此高深玄妙的精神世界，其复杂程度连共枕十几年的爱人也无法懂得。他所谓的精神世界，究竟是小众中大众的标签拼贴出的艺术作品，还是精心为她打造的「请勿打扰」的房间，这是表演欲驱动下构筑的空中楼阁吗？我们不得而知，也许只有下一个他的「影子」才能懂得些许。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 虽然我不爱你了但是原因在你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 没想到你在工作的时候原来是这幅面孔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 第一次听citypop那又怎样我立马就做一张小卖几张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 只要有听众就开始告状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 70% 太多啦 50% 我会比较舒服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 嘲笑你一下我们都很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 她为啥要哭啊那我该怎么办啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 他俩拿你打赌我默不作声，杨总让我磕头我厉声拒绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 为了证明你不是个好妈妈居然把我不是个好爸爸这件事暴露了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 我不关心你的精神世界，但是我的精神世界之美妙之高深你连懂都不懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 说精神世界都是骗你们哒，有面儿才是我渴求的</span></p><span></span><p><span>「听我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljyAyP6YflbN_Ps0f43zu3_F8qc5.m4a" length="32259150" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5AffZNiOdt4SJrmmp5aldpiHGX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.57 不好意思用显微镜看了《再见爱人》第四季第三期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6754678fbdb9877a971267ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6754678fbdb9877a971267ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有话说」</span></p><span></span><p><span>当她望向你，你的存在对她才有价值。当你关注她，她才能感受到你在身边。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 刘杨联盟正在成立中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 我配拥有一杯咖啡吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 我就没什么兴趣爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 我送你我想送的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 不翼而飞的导游手册</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 你被声讨我才有流量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 把演技奉献给真人秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 无条件信任半路亲人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 没有人真的了解爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 我肯定能成为好XX</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 不同意我就表演愤怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 当理工男变成挡箭牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> 你的孩子需要被理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 百分之八的御夫之术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 观察室长了一条舌头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> 站在悬崖前的杨子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a> 刺猬般纯真的大男孩</span></p><span></span><p><span>「听我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lno_oaGgpNHQ7Raf8z8rW_K72Eru.m4a" length="38181879" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5AffZNiOdt4SJrmmp5aldpiHGX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.56 不好意思用显微镜看了《再见爱人》第四季第二期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c0a160ed328720a99f87e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674c0a160ed328720a99f87e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有话说」</span></p><span></span><p><span>情绪稳定的你为何行为屡屡失控？共同做导游怎么权力是你的责任是她的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 明明是衣柜的「零分时刻」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 情绪稳定地扔衣服，摔可乐，砸琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 明明夫妻俩一起做导游，奈何责任自动落到一个人头上了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 对内人：让他买啊；对外人：焦虑是她的本色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 理智并心平气和地解决问题所以默默扔衣服了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 你肯定能安排好大家的旅程，我也有 50% 的决定权所以买吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> 价值感层面得不到满足是因为什么呢？班能治百病吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a> 看似全职主妇，实则全职主妇加助理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 这是三位男士商量出来的结果～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 大家没共情我一定是我没表演好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 虽然但是……但是后面是重点</span></p><span></span><p><span>「听我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltvW954QOSu63u-ppVI5UUiyciuw.m4a" length="34908783" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5AffZNiOdt4SJrmmp5aldpiHGX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.55 不好意思用显微镜看了《再见爱人》第四季第一集</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ebc7911045e78e5bea0a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ebc7911045e78e5bea0a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有话说」</span></p><span></span><p><span>冷漠不是理性，诡辩也不是讲理。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「时间轴」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 你对观察类真人秀的看法是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 开场几分钟贴心好丈夫形象就有了雏形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 为什么结婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 都是别人让我这么做的～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 我答不出来题目那我可惨了（嗯？你也没被怎么样吧）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 其实她很了解你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 为什么她这么节约？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 我都可以，我支持你，无论你做什么决定我都支持～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 我希望你是符合我的审美，在乎我的精神，关注我的需求，又不插手我在事业上的决定的心肝呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 强势地表达自己的不满：有令到我不舒服的部分我是可以表达的，于是一桩桩一件件全抖出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 你胖～但是我喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> 我能怎么办啊，她不满意啊，我都做了啊，鬼打墙了啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 你非要拉仇恨干嘛～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> 小S语录：我们徐家堡枪口一致对外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 塑造“疯女人”形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2873">47:53</a> 黄杨&amp;葛刘</span></p><span></span><p><span>「听我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、苹果播客、荔枝、QQ音乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh-YjADWIdOablJsmA2O1kLmscYs.m4a" length="47418273" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5AffZNiOdt4SJrmmp5aldpiHGX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.54 杨德昌《独立时代》</title>
